# Not a new dependency: pytest (and qrcode) require colorama on Windows only, so
# pip-compile on macOS/Linux leaves it out of the lock, and the hash-checked
# `pip install -r requirements-dev.txt` then fails on a Windows machine. Listed here
# without a marker so the lock pins it for every platform (it is tiny and pure Python).
